{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pulls/1024","id":4956525987,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJgfwyc8AAAABJ26Vow","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pull/1024","diff_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pull/1024.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pull/1024.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/issues/1024","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pulls/1024/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pulls/1024/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/issues/1024/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/WuKongIM/statuses/c91e37b4e35e1009c9c5cb55ff351a38b870014f","number":1024,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: retain bounded terminal cloud diagnostics","user":{"login":"tangtaoit","id":3895878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTU4Nzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3895878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit","html_url":"https://github.com/tangtaoit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Terminal cloud diagnostics could omit the workload’s already-produced failure examples and lose the entire Prometheus range when a response exceeded 4 MiB. The range also followed collection time instead of the actual terminal report. This change collects bounded, validated worker/status documents and eight fixed metric partitions anchored to the terminal report, preserving successful partitions and explicitly recording missing or partial evidence.\n\nThe collector binds run/generation/snapshot identity, retains the raw terminal timestamp while using Prometheus millisecond query precision, and requires a valid failed-before-capacity state before exempting missing capacity documents. Metric partitions share 24 MiB and 60 seconds; zero-loss qualification, product runtime and cloud lifecycle remain unchanged. The actual collector fixture moves into the integration tier, and its optional artifact variable uses a non-WK_ name so it cannot enter product configuration.\n\nValidation: tests were written and run against the old implementation first. Final focused validation passes two Go entries and 79 process cases across 20 Python methods. Full scripts default tests pass (391 root cases, one existing GNU awk environment skip). The full Mac supplementary integration suite passed on its first v2 run in 657.684 seconds (645 root cases, 11 existing environment/opt-in/fixture skips, zero failures). Exact Linux policy CI remains pending before merge. Independent Standards and Spec reviews closed the two initial P2 findings with no new findings. An independent 52-case helper probe also passed.\n\nEvidence limitations: preserve the initial WK_ fixture configuration failure, fixture-only setup errors, corrected behavioral RED and all subsequent results. The Mac supplementary integration watchdog is 12 minutes because the prior full run took 528.792 seconds before the additional process cases; it does not replace the unchanged 9-minute Linux named check. The original cloud message-loss cause remains unproven; this change improves evidence and does not claim to fix or waive that product verdict. No new cloud run or release is started by this PR.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T18:36:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T18:36:21Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4f9e71ac3976fab087833bb230c391cd5ea5f46e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WuKongIM:codex/v3-rc-terminal-evidence","ref":"codex/v3-rc-terminal-evidence","repo":{"id":638054601,"node_id":"R_kgDOJgfwyQ","name":"WuKongIM","full_name":"WuKongIM/WuKongIM","owner":{"login":"WuKongIM","id":132860831,"node_id":"O_kgDOB-tLnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132860831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"More than just IM 不只是即时通讯(IM)","homepage":"https://docs.githubim.com","language":"Go","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["agent","chat","im","message"],"forks_count":712,"forks":712,"stargazers_count":4966,"watchers_count":4966,"watchers":4966,"open_issues_count":80,"open_issues":80,"size":227725,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages"